        "observation": "Search results for 'spatial_and_single_cell' under C:\\Users\\32472\\Desktop\\MaastrichtUni\\MscAI\\ProjectSem2\\Phase3\\Group-25-Research-Project\\Papers\\21-66M-fadvi\\repo:\ndocs/tutorials/advanced_usage.rst:349: * Explore :doc:`spatial_and_single_cell` for integrating spatial transcriptomics data with single-cell data\ndocs/tutorials/basic_usage.rst:231: * Explore :doc:`spatial_and_single_cell` for integrating spatial transcriptomics data with single-cell data\ndocs/tutorials/index.rst:12: spatial_and_single_cell",
